theta = 1/1260 = 7.936508e-04
For each core C={1..13}\{e}: floor=(6/7)meas(G_C), bound-N = r/(7(floor-theta)),
and TRUE-N = smallest vmax s.t. min_{w>=vmax} L(C+w) > theta.
